@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@channelId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@authorId = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Create a message and publish MessagePostedEvent
# @name createMessage
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channelId": "{{channelId}}",
  "authorId": "{{authorId}}",
  "content": "Hello Bizcord"
}

### Replace this with messageId from the POST response
@messageId = 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333

### Read one
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/messages/{{messageId}}

### Read messages for one channel
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/messages?channelId={{channelId}}

### Edit the content
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/messages/{{messageId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"content": "Edited message"}

### Delete the message
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/messages/{{messageId}}

### Invalid content: expect 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{"channelId": "{{channelId}}", "authorId": "{{authorId}}", "content": "   "}

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
